🚀 API to PostgreSQL ETL Pipeline

📌 Project Overview
This project demonstrates an end-to-end ETL (Extract, Transform, Load) pipeline built using Python and PostgreSQL.

The pipeline automatically extracts customer data from a REST API, validates and transforms the incoming JSON data, loads it into PostgreSQL tables, and generates business reports using SQL queries, joins, aggregations, and analytical functions.

🎯 Objectives
Extract data from REST APIs
Transform JSON data into a relational format
Load data into PostgreSQL
Perform SQL-based business analysis
Generate meaningful reports
Demonstrate ETL workflow used in Data Engineering

