📥 Data Extraction
Customer data is retrieved from a REST API using Python Requests.


Example:
response = requests.get(API_URL)
data = response.json()
🔍 Data Validation
The pipeline validates:

Missing values
Null records
Invalid customer IDs
Improper data types
This ensures only high-quality data enters the database.

🔄 Data Transformation
JSON responses are transformed into a structured relational format compatible with PostgreSQL.

Example:

{
  "id": 1,
  "name": "Sai",
  "email": "sai@gmail.com"
}
Transformed Into:

{
  "customer_id": 1,
  "customer_name": "Sai",
  "email": "sai@gmail.com"
}
